/130709eeffbfe9a37fb4b3403bbf7d6c.poster.avif?t=1789296688\" width=616 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435470/extras/130709eeffbfe9a37fb4b3403bbf7d6c.webm?t=1789296688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435470/extras/c8804d8412bb49ca80d51724125a29c1.webp?t=1789296688\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reflect bullets and chop up enemies with your sword.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435470/extras/aa5dca0bda209f072b063d815cb68522.poster.avif?t=1789296688\" width=616 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435470/extras/aa5dca0bda209f072b063d815cb68522.webm?t=1789296688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435470/extras/c8804d8412bb49ca80d51724125a29c1.webp?t=1789296688\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blow up enemies with grenades and then hide in the smoke while you shoot more enemies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435470/extras/365d9968a17dbb481e9f42556da30806.poster.avif?t=1789296688\" width=616 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435470/extras/365d9968a17dbb481e9f42556da30806.webm?t=1789296688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akama